## Monorepo Structure

18 package surfaces in a four-way nest under `packages/`: **13 Python + 1 Rust + 1 TS design-system + 3 apps** (terminal, desktop, site). Python source for each package lives under `src/flinttrade_<pkg>/` (never a bare `src/<file>.py`). The `chrome-extension` package was dropped in the v0.6.0 restructure. The active desktop package uses Electron with verified local-source bootstrap; its manifest records the current version. The source-built web app remains distinct from Electron-shell installers; a release is accepted only as all four canonical installers plus `SHA256SUMS.txt`, and retired Tauri and PyInstaller assets never satisfy that gate.

#### `packages/core/` — runtime foundation (4 Python + 1 Rust + 1 TS)

| Package | Lang | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `core/core` | Py | Flask app, config, workspace, models, exceptions, JWT/auth; optional OpenAlgo client |
| `core/data` | Py | Tick recorder, local audit logger, trade logger, DuckDB storage |
| `core/historical` | Py | OHLCV downloader, free data (OpenChart/yfinance), DuckDB pipeline, expiry manager |
| `core/indicators` | Py | TA-Lib (batch, 150+ indicators) + Numba (streaming) + PineTS (Pine Script conversion) |
| `core/ticks` | Rust/PyO3 | High-performance tick processing engine (Rust core with Python bindings via PyO3) |
| `core/design-system` | TS | Shared FlintTrade tokens, layers, brand primitives, and React components |

#### `packages/services/` — domain services (7 Python)

| Package | Description |
|---|---|
| `services/engine` | 5-layer safety system, order router, scheduler, base strategy, strategy registry, mode guard |
| `services/screener` | Option chain, OI analysis, PCR, max pain, futures quadrant, portfolio Greeks, IV |
| `services/backtest` | Simulator, metrics (Sharpe/Sortino/DD), walk-forward, Monte Carlo, 94 strategy templates |
| `services/ai` | LLM client (multi-provider), RAG (local sqlite3/NumPy vector store), signals, sentiment, MCP bridge, advisor |
| `services/automation` | Cron manager, Telegram bot with kill switch, post-market analysis |
| `services/ditto` | Multi-account manager, position mirror, margin calculator, trailing SL, risk manager |
| `services/journal` | Trade journal, execution-quality analytics, and realised P&L tracking |

#### `packages/integrations/` — external surfaces (2 Python)

| Package | Description |
|---|---|
| `integrations/gateway` | Native broker gateway: `BrokerAdapter` Protocol (`adapter.py`), per-broker adapters in `brokers/` (catalogued in `BROKER_CATALOG`; verify counts with `test_adapter.py`), `registry.py`, `BrokerRouter` (`router.py`); five founder-broker native adapters exist (Dhan, Upstox, Kotak Neo, INDmoney, Groww); Dhan, Upstox, and Kotak Neo are connectable (Kotak Neo Connected (read) / API smoke only on FT-MONDAY-002 — Live place fail-closed; Neo has no sandbox); INDmoney and Groww retain declared activation blockers; required SDKs are pinned in `brokers.lock` and attested before activation; OpenAlgo is the optional primary bridge adapter; `shims/` holds OpenAlgo infra shims only |
| `integrations/webhooks` | Generic HMAC-signed custom webhooks, flow builder, alerter |

